{"id":"b7d1e4a2-0000-4000-8000-000000000104","revision":0,"last_node_id":4,"last_link_id":4,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"STLU_QwenEditLoader","pos":[0,0],"size":[380,170],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"clip_name","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"vae_name","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"clip_type","name":"clip_type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_type"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[1]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","links":[2]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[3]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"STLU_QwenEditLoader"},"widgets_values":["qwen_image_2.1_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors","qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors","qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors","qwen_image"]},{"id":2,"type":"STLU_PsdUpscalePrepare","pos":[440,0],"size":[560,760],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"psd_path","name":"psd_path","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"psd_path"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"reference_path","name":"reference_path","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"reference_path"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"factor","name":"factor","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"factor"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_side","name":"max_side","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_side"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"work_max_side","name":"work_max_side","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"work_max_side"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"margin","name":"margin","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"margin"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"out_dir","name":"out_dir","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"out_dir"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"psd_name","name":"psd_name","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"psd_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"select","name":"select","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"select"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sub_dir","name":"sub_dir","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"sub_dir"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"negative_prompt","name":"negative_prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"negative_prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"plan_json","name":"plan_json","type":"STRING","links":[4]},{"localized_name":"info","name":"info","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"title":"PSD 放大准备","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"STLU_PsdUpscalePrepare"},"widgets_values":["","",2.0,4096,2048,0.08,42,"fixed","SeeThrough/PsdUpscale","","all","输出一张带透明背景、带透明通道的 PNG 图层图片。把这张图放大到更高分辨率，保持原有造型、配色、构图和轮廓不变；修复 AI 生成留下的瑕疵：去掉噪点与杂色，理清模糊、锯齿或断裂的边缘，让发丝根根分明、线条干净连续；补充清晰的纹理细节，不要添加或删除任何元素。背景必须完全透明，不要白底、边框、阴影或补齐背景，只保留这一层的像素。","","",1.0]},{"id":3,"type":"STLU_PsdUpscaleMin","pos":[1060,0],"size":[420,210],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":1},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":2},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":3},{"localized_name":"plan_json","name":"plan_json","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"plan_json"},"link":4},{"localized_name":"edit_template","name":"edit_template","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"edit_template"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"psd_path","name":"psd_path","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"info","name":"info","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"title":"PSD 放大执行","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"STLU_PsdUpscaleMin"},"widgets_values":["","qwen_image_edit_2.1"]},{"id":4,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-384,320],"size":[760,340],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["### PSD 放大（精简版）\n\n**用法**\n\n1. 加载器已填好常用的 UNET / CLIP / VAE，换模型时只改三个下拉框。\n2. 『放大准备』点『选择成品 PSD』，勾选要放大的图层（默认全选），调好倍率与单层上限；运行后把 `plan_json` 交给『放大执行』。\n3. 『参考原图』可选：选一张与 PSD 同构图的高分辨率原图，发丝与边缘细节就照真实像素修；不选则只靠模型补细节。\n4. 轮廓直接沿用原图层：裁剪图以带透明通道的 RGBA 送进模型，模型放大后返回自己的透明通道，不再做任何二次切割。\n5. 种子只在这里填，每层种子 = 种子 + 层序号，逐层递增。同一张 PSD 用同一种子结果可复现。\n6. 『输出位置』可改根目录（output 下的相对路径）、子目录和 PSD 名称；不填名称则用 `<原文件名>_upscaled`。默认在 `output/SeeThrough/PsdUpscale/<PSD 名>/`，完成后可在面板里打开目录。\n7. 『负向提示词』只在 CFG > 1 时生效：默认 CFG 1 最快，填了负向结果也不会变；要压制某种效果就把 CFG 调到 2-4，代价是每步算两遍、速度约翻倍，太高会过饱和。\n\n**固定参数**：denoise 1.0、8 步 sigmas、euler；cfg 默认 1，可调。\n\n默认提示词已允许修复 AI 瑕疵（噪点、锯齿、模糊边、断裂发丝），并明确要求输出带透明通道、背景完全透明（开头结尾各强调一次），降低模型输出白底卡片的概率；裁剪图以带透明通道的 RGBA 送进模型，轮廓因此沿用原图层、由模型放大后原样返回。需要改这些行为，直接说需求，不在工作流里加控件。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[2,1,1,3,1,"CLIP"],[3,1,2,3,2,"VAE"],[4,2,0,3,3,"STRING"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"① 模型加载（Qwen Image Edit）","bounding":[-30,-60,440,300],"color":"#4a3f5a","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"② 输入（放大准备）","bounding":[410,-60,620,820],"color":"#3f5a3f","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"③ 放大执行","bounding":[1040,-60,470,300],"color":"#3f4a5a","flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"frontendVersion":"1.55.18","ds":{"scale":1.4641000000000006,"offset":[-307.86581224940585,-918.2063397381971]}},"version":0.4}